$comment
ERROR EXAMPLE: Missing $end terminator on the $molecule block.
Q-Chem requires every section to end with $end on its own line. Without
it, the parser keeps reading into the next section.
Q-Chem error: "Unexpected $rem inside $molecule" / SECTION_PARSE_ERROR.
Fix: add the missing $end after the last atom.
$end

$molecule
0 1
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.117300
H   0.000000   0.756950  -0.469200
H   0.000000  -0.756950  -0.469200

$rem
   JOBTYPE   opt
   METHOD    b3lyp
   BASIS    6-31G*
$end
